# The Debian/Ubuntu packages that the systems umbrella's native parts need to
# build and test, one per line: the salix_signal_proto (libsodium) and
# salix_signal (libopus) NIFs, ex_libsrtp and ex_dtls (salix_meet_native), the
# verified kernel (cmake, libuv, OpenSSL), and FFmpeg. CI
# (.github/actions/systems-test-build) and the coding sandbox image (its
# Dockerfile) install this list, so a package that CI needs is also in the
# sandbox.
libsodium-dev
libopus-dev
libsrtp2-dev
pkg-config
cmake
libuv1-dev
libssl-dev
ffmpeg
